# Implementation Plan - Consumer Flow Refinement

# Goal Description
Enhance the Consumer application to be fully functional and navigable, allowing users to:
1.  Register and Login.
2.  Browse nearby stores (mocked but navigable).
3.  View store inventory.
4.  Add items to a global Cart.

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> We will introduce a lightweight `CartContext` to manage state client-side for this MVP.

